<title>BELGIUM: Heavy money foils Belgian bank robbers.</title>
<headline>Heavy money foils Belgian bank robbers.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Belgian robbers who used a bulldozer to demolish a bank wall to get at a cash dispenser in southern Belgium left without the money when the trailer they put the safe on collapsed under the weight, a bank spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
